{
  "_comment": "Generated from decompiled Ball X Pit enums, cross-checked live against the game's own InfoDB.I.Buildings/BlueprintsByLevel data (see project memory) rather than the wiki, which has repeatedly disagreed with confirmed live data (wrong per-level placements for several buildings) and should not be trusted over a live dump. 'id' values are a frozen ID registry shared by the ballxpit apworld's item_name_to_id/location_name_to_id (same numeric id used for both the item and location of a given entry - safe since AP keeps those in separate namespaces), computed as 900100 + the entry's ordinal position in the real BuildingType enum - so a later-added entry's id is fixed by its enum position, not by append order. Buildings confirmed to have BuildingInfo.IsInGame == false (real cut/unused content - granting them does nothing visible, and vanilla's own blueprint-drop logic silently skips them entirely, confirmed live) were dropped rather than guessed at. The 7 remaining kXIdol entries (display name '... Trophy') are the per-level first-completion reward buildings - confirmed real and live (granted automatically on first level completion). kMoonIdol (Void Trophy) is deliberately excluded and permanently suppressed by the mod regardless of AP connection state - it's repurposed as BlueprintShuffle's dedicated placeholder sentinel for the per-level discovery-chain mechanism (see BlueprintShuffle.cs), so its ownership flag must never be set by anything else; the building itself no longer exists as obtainable content in any seed. kWheatField/kForest/kBoulder were removed (not just 'unconfirmed' - confirmed real, but granted automatically as starter content the instant a new save is created, not through any real player action, so a 'Blueprint: X' check firing for them was disconnected from actual play - reported live and removed). kFarm/kLumberyard/kStoneMine/kGatherersHut were removed after discovering they're dead IsInGame==false enum values superseded by kIdleFarm/kIdleLumberyard/kIdleStoneMine/kIdleLauncher (same display names, the real currently-functioning buildings) - the old entries were permanently unreachable locations. 16 additional real buildings (kMasseuse, kIdleManagement, the 6 stat buildings, kIdleLauncher, kCobbler, kIdleFarm/kIdleLumberyard/kIdleStoneMine, kHovel, kBrickHouse, kLogCabin) were added after being found live in InfoDB.I.Buildings/BlueprintsByLevel but missing from this file. Do not renumber surviving entries if this file is regenerated again - only append or drop.",
